  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-16T22:42:33.777Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When loading a VRChat world, there might be times where I want to abort the load and go back to my home world. My reaction time to click \"Go Home\" is usually too late, and I load into the world I wasn't yet ready to join.\n\nI'm thinking that VRChat should have a controller option to enable the panic mode buttons to send you home from the loading screen. If the button inputs are detected during the loading screen, it sends you to your home instance instead.",
